{
  No Fall Damage + No Air Break + Entity Immunity + BadBall AI Fix
  Credits to BookwormKevin for the original script!
  Players 1-4 respawn when falling into void (native Ball_Respawn).
  Badballs immune to killplanes (don't disappear).
  All balls always collide with bumpers, mousetraps, badballs.

  Patches:
  1. Ball_Shatter (0x8D70): RET 4
  2. Ball_SplitDeath (0x9050): RET
  3. Ball_FallDeath (0x9480): set 0x2E8=1 only (triggers respawn)
  4. bounce_count (0x75C9): NOP
  5. Collision skip checks (38 locations): NOP — collision always runs
  6. Hook1 (+1B591): clear 0x2E8 for entity balls in list 1 (prevent destroy)
  7. Hook2 (+1B636): clear 0x2E8 for entity balls in list 2 (prevent destroy)
}

[ENABLE]

